# Interrupt: esc while the answer streams. The first 12-rune chunk is followed by a
# 1.5 s gap, so esc always lands between chunks and the frame is deterministic.
name: interrupt
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default "Give me a long answer"
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/interrupt.json
parity: TC-01, TC-14, TR-28
---
ready
wait_for 30s Stop here.
keys esc
settle 5s
checkpoint interrupted
type Short answer please
keys enter
wait_for 30s Fine, a short answer then.
settle
checkpoint after
